-- src/core/session.ail
-- Phase C live v2 driver: the imperative shell over a pure step machine.
--
-- This module owns the real effect row and is the sole emitter of ledger
-- events. Per step it lifts C2LoopState into a StepState, calls the pure
-- `decide` (src/core/step_machine.ail), and executes the returned
-- StepDecision through phases (model_phase / tool_phase / hook_phase) and
-- ports. State deltas flow through apply_state_delta.
--
-- Continuation is state, not a field: `decide` re-derives each
-- CallModel / RunTools / AwaitApproval / Finalize / Fail decision from
-- typed StepState fields, and c2_loop tail-recurses with the next state.
--
-- This is the only agent loop. The legacy rpc_loop was deleted in the
-- M-MOTOKO-RPC-LOOP-FULL-MIGRATION cutover; rpc.ail is now a thin entry
-- point that builds config and calls run_v2_with_conversation here.
-- src/core/agent_loop_v2.ail is a compatibility facade re-exporting
-- these entry points under the historical import surface.
--
-- Companion to: src/core/step_machine.ail (pure decide),
-- src/core/phase_vocab.ail (sealed types + transcript gate),
-- src/core/ports.ail (port adapters), src/core/tool_phase.ail.
--
-- Companion to: src/core/tool_dispatch_adapter (M1), src/core/tool_catalog (M2)

